ngul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">*Each successful scholar will have to purchase\neconomy class one-way ticket to Korea with one’s own wherewithal and the\nairfare will be reimbursed by KIT after entering Korea.</span></u></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> <u><o:p></o:p></u></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">*Scholar will have to pay one’s tuition fee by\noneself during each semester including the first semester.<o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">2.\nRequired Language Proficiency Test Result<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Applicants <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal\">MUST</b> submit one of below official language proficiency test\ncertificates.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- minimum language proficiency\ntest certificate: TOPIK level 3, TOEIC 750, TOEFL PBT 550, TOEFL ibt 79, TEPS\n327, IELTS 6.0 or higher <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- Eligibility requirements are\nlimited to the results of the language test taken within the last two years as\nof the application deadline for KIT-GKS admission<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- If candidates are from the\ncountry where English is spoken as first language (USA, Canada, UK, Ireland,\nAustralia, New Zealand), the English proficiency test will not be required to\nhand in<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">3.\nEligibility<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please refer to the attached KIT-GKS\nApplication Guidelines. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">4. Obligation for KIT-GKS\nrecipients<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">-\nKIT-GKS recipients are obligated to either find a job at local companies or\npursue higher degree at universities located in Gyeongsangbuk-do and to\nmaintain residency in Gyeongsangbuk-do for three years after one’s graduation. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">-\nKIT-GKS final nominees are highly recommended to attend “Gyeongbuk Global\nSchool” program before the start of the semester if possible. Gyeongbuk Global\nSchool will last two weeks in August 2024, and is a program that introduces\npolicy of Gyeongsangbuk-do and provides scholars with opportunities to\nexperience Korean culture, laws and etc., to help them study and settle in\nGyeongsangbuk-do. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">5.\nRestriction<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- Applicants must choose and\napply for only ONE scholarship program offered by KIT. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- If an applicant applied to more\nthan one scholarship program offered by KIT, his or her application will be\ndisregarded at the 2<sup>nd</sup> round of selection. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- For other restrictions, please\nrefer to the attached KIT-GKS Application Guidelines. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">All required documents must be\nwritten by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no\ne-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application for this\nKIT-GKS admission stage.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">For further information, please\nsee attached, visit website (</span></span><a href=\"https://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">https://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">) or contact KIT-GKS coordinator.\nThank you. </span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission Deadline:&nbsp;May 24<sup>th</sup>,\n(Friday), 2024<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission Address:</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">[English]<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: